# Conclude — Procedure

## Goal

```
Preserve unfinished human and worker obligations before settling. Automation never settles a standing agent; it remains unsettled in the sidebar. For other threads, a resting conversation or a delivered or withdrawn todo's orchestrator thread, use native settling, which applies when its current turn ends. A human-settled standing thread stays reachable and wakes on a message.
```

